<title>USA: ACNielsen buys 100 pct Nielsen S. Africa.</title>
<headline>ACNielsen buys 100 pct Nielsen S. Africa.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn. 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ACNielsen Corp said on Tuesday it paid $7 million for the remaining 75.1 percent of ACNielsen South Africa that it did not already own.</p>
<p>The stake was acquired from Integrated Business Information Services for $3.5 million in cash up front, with the remainder to be paid over the next two years.</p>
<p>ACNielsen had divested itself of its South Africa business in 1987.  It repurchased 24.9 percent from Integrated in 1994.</p>
